{"id":"664975","name":"荔枝乌鸡汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/664975/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"乌鸡","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"荔枝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"乌鸡冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/664975/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红枣清洗干净备用。","img":"images/664975/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净的乌鸡放入砂锅中。","img":"images/664975/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入红枣。","img":"images/664975/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/664975/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上大火煮开转小火煲40分钟。","img":"images/664975/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"荔枝去皮清洗一下备用。","img":"images/664975/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"分钟后的鸡汤煲。","img":"images/664975/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入荔枝。","img":"images/664975/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"继续小火煲15分钟左右，出锅少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/664975/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664975/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/664975/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}